DreamUMGWidgetInteraction:PressKey {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/UMG/DreamUMGWidgetInteraction.h#DreamUMGWidgetInteraction:PressKey
    src   "Press a key as if it had come from the keyboard.  Avoid using this for 'a-z|A-Z', things like\nthe Editable Textbox in Slate expect OnKeyChar to be called to signal a specific character being\nsend to the widget.  So for those cases you should use SendKeyChar."
    // from the engine's zh-Hans
    text  "按下一个键，假定其来自键盘。不要将“a-z|A-Z”用于此键。Slate中可编辑文本框之类的内容预计将调用OnKeyChar，发出将特定角色发送至控件的通知。因此在这些情况下应使用SendKeyChar。"
    state draft
}

DreamUMGWidgetInteraction:PressPointerKey {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/UMG/DreamUMGWidgetInteraction.h#DreamUMGWidgetInteraction:PressPointerKey
    src   "Presses a key as if the mouse/pointer were the source of it.  Normally you would just use\nLeft/Right mouse button for the Key.  However - advanced uses could also be imagined where you\nsend other keys to signal widgets to take special actions if they're under the cursor.\n\nFor the first pointer still over the surface (CurrentPointerEventData); with none, nothing is\npressed. A touch key presses as that pointer's touch."
    text  "按下某个键，就像该键来自鼠标/指针一样。通常只需将\n左/右鼠标键用作 Key。不过，也可以设想一些高级用法：\n发送其他按键，以通知光标下的控件执行特殊操作。\n\n作用于仍位于表面上的第一个指针（CurrentPointerEventData）；若没有这样的指针，则不会\n按下任何内容。触摸键会以该指针的触摸方式按下。"
    state machine
}

