DreamUMGWidgetInteraction:ReleasePointerKey {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/UMG/DreamUMGWidgetInteraction.h#DreamUMGWidgetInteraction:ReleasePointerKey
    src   "Releases a key as if the mouse/pointer were the source of it.  Normally you would just use\nLeft/Right mouse button for the Key.  However - advanced uses could also be imagined where you\nsend other keys to signal widgets to take special actions if they're under the cursor.\n\nFor the pointer PressPointerKey acts for."
    text  "释放某个键，就像该键由鼠标/指针释放一样。通常只需将\n左/右鼠标键用作 Key。不过，也可以设想一些高级用法：\n发送其他按键，以通知光标下的控件执行特殊操作。\n\n作用于 PressPointerKey 所作用的指针。"
    state machine
}

